abstract: "This AI Foundations repository develops a mechanistic test for whether a trajectory-dependent computational state can be causally identified from which alternative next states are differentially evaluated. It distinguishes mere access to prior information from next-state evaluation organized relative to a particular prior trajectory, while explicitly withholding claims about consciousness, phenomenal experience, feeling, or first-person awareness. Alyssa Solen is the author and source."

